{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766610/extras/gameplay_2.gif?t=1748639329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Spider Canyon </i>is a physics platformer game set in the dangerous <i>Mojave</i> desert. Jump through hand-crafted environments to test your wits and parkour skills to reach the finish the line the fastest. Bounce, leap, and survive. <strong>Gravity is your playground!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766610/extras/gameplay_1.gif?t=1748639329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot webs that turn once hard and dangerous surfaces of the desert into bounce pads to navigate the environment with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precise physics based movement to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the in-game timer to track your progress and chase the time down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game free movement mode to explore the level and plot your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>24</strong> hand made levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalist and clean UI and graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desert themed soundtrack and sound effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766610/extras/gameplay_3.gif?t=1748639329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3766610?t=1748639329","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766610/c1788c6b581607f926107bcdaf